+    R -->|no| U1["Inadmissible as a deterministic fact;<br/>renders Unknown"]
+    R -->|yes| A{"Entry has an effective owner act<br/>under RFC3-16(a)?"}
+    A -->|no| U2["Admits nothing; renders Unknown<br/>as if unregistered"]
+    A -->|"yes, state (1) or (2)"| V{"Claimed per-adapter<br/>contract version? (RFC4-8)"}
+    V -->|"not defined by this RFC"| X["Inadmissible until the<br/>entry is corrected (d)"]
+    V -->|"older than the kernel expects"| OLD["Admitted at the declared version;<br/>unemitted fields render Unknown (c)"]
+    V -->|current| OK["Admitted, provenance state carried"]
